  <jpcrp_cor:PlaceForPublicInspectionCoverPageTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;letter-spacing:0.0pt;line-height:18.0pt;"&gt;※株式会社中電工  広島統括支社&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:14pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:3pt;margin-bottom:3pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;(広島市南区皆実町一丁目９番35号)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;株式会社中電工  岡山統括支社&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:14pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:3pt;margin-bottom:3pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;(岡山市南区浜野四丁目２番７号)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;株式会社中電工  山口統括支社&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:14pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:3pt;margin-bottom:3pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;(山口市大内千坊六丁目８番１号)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;※株式会社中電工  島根統括支社&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:14pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:3pt;margin-bottom:3pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;(松江市西津田四丁目８番47号)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&a